                {"english": "Indigenous native communities are leading conservation initiatives to protect ancestral sacred sites from industrial development encroachments.", "chinese": "世代在此繁衍生息的本土原住民部落正在全面主导生态文保倡议，誓死捍卫先祖留下的神圣遗址免遭现代工矿开发的肆意侵占蚕食。"},
